### 3) PUNTOS DE ENTREGA
### -----------------------------
### Listado público
GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery_points
Accept: application/json

### Productos de un punto (id=1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery_points/1/products
Accept: application/json

### Mis puntos (Usuario 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery_points/myPoints?id_user=1
Authorization: Bearer 3|lUpZD7AsbH99zw7msZihUQq7MED9nHuBLI5Z7XrR60739cdd
Accept: application/json

### Crear punto (Usuario 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/delivery_points/store
Authorization: Bearer 3|lUpZD7AsbH99zw7msZihUQq7MED9nHuBLI5Z7XrR60739cdd
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id_user": 1,
  "name": "Puesto Mercado Central",
  "direction": "C/ Mayor 1",
  "latitude": 39.4702,
  "length": -0.3768
}

### Actualizar punto (id=1) (Usuario 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/delivery_points/update/1
Authorization: Bearer 3|lUpZD7AsbH99zw7msZihUQq7MED9nHuBLI5Z7XrR60739cdd
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Puesto Mercado Central (Actualizado)"
}

### Eliminar punto (id=1) (Usuario 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/delivery_points/destroy/1
Authorization: Bearer 3|lUpZD7AsbH99zw7msZihUQq7MED9nHuBLI5Z7XrR60739cdd
Accept: application/json

