### Crear producto (Usuario 1) (usa delivery_point y category válidos)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/store
Authorization: Bearer 3|lUpZD7AsbH99zw7msZihUQq7MED9nHuBLI5Z7XrR60739cdd
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

